<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 17.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 17.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   McIntosh Sec	    12.00   0.75</p>
<p> 2   Multistack		10.34   0.29</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 10.32   0.95</p>
<p> 4   Villa World	     10.28   1.07</p>
<p> 5   Indu Property	   10.22   0.89</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   10.14   1.61</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	  9.91   1.03</p>
<p> 8   Colonial Mutual	  9.80   1.08</p>
<p> 9   Central Equity	   9.38   0.96</p>
<p>10   Centro Prop		9.03   2.16</p>
<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	 8.86   0.88</p>
<p>12   Nth Building Soc	 8.85   2.60</p>
<p>13   Barclays Mirvac	  8.80   1.25</p>
<p>14   Gen Prop Tr		8.78   2.29</p>
<p>15   Aust Tour		  8.72   0.86</p>
<p>16   Armstrong Retail	 8.67   0.75</p>
<p>17   Westpac Prop Tr	  8.58   1.58</p>
